<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/learning-record-consumer-lrc> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An xAPI Client that retrieves Learning Records from one or more Learning Record Stores for processing such as interpretation, analysis, translation, dissemination, or aggregation." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/learning-record-consumer-lrc/versions/1> .
