<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/learning-record-consumer-lrc> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/editorialExplanation> "xAPI is not only about sending data into an LRS. LRCs represent the consuming side of the ecosystem, where records are turned into analytics, services, reports, or other downstream uses." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/learning-record-consumer-lrc/versions/1> .
